{"path":"ranges/enumerate_view/iterator/operator_arith2","title":"operator+,-(ranges::enumerate_view::iterator)","titleHtml":"operator+,-<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(ranges::enumerate_view::<i>iterator</i>)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/enumerate_view/iterator/operator_arith2","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Performs iterator arithmetic or calculates the distance.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* iterator */</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* iterator */</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> i, difference_type n <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/random_access_range\"><span class=\"kw2924\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">random_access_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* Base */</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* iterator */</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> difference_type n, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* iterator */</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> i <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/random_access_range\"><span class=\"kw2924\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">random_access_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=